cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Plastanno, please cite it with the metadata below, and cite the
  reference database it downloads (Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.20807994).
type: software
title: "Plastanno"
abstract: >-
  Plastanno annotates plastid (chloroplast) genomes -- CDS, tRNA and rRNA -- from
  a FASTA file. Two independent engines (Exonerate protein2genome and profile
  HMMs) propose candidates, a single selector keeps one feature per locus, and
  every feature carries a review flag and its provenance.
